---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import DesktopDownload from '../components/DesktopDownload.astro';
import { ArrowLeft, Monitor, Server, ArrowUpRight } from '@lucide/astro';
---
<Layout title="Download BoxBox | Linux Desktop & Self-hosted Server" description="Get BoxBox Desktop for Linux x86_64 or deploy the BoxBox server with Docker. Choose the right package, verify checksums, and connect your files.">
  <main class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl flex-1 px-5 pt-10 pb-24 md:pt-16">
    <a href="/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 text-sm text-text-secondary hover:text-white"><ArrowLeft class="h-4 w-4" /> BoxBox home</a>
    <h1 class="mt-10 text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white md:text-7xl">Get BoxBox.</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-xl leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">A desktop app for your computer. A self-hosted server for your homelab. Use either on its own, or pair them together.</p>
    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-12 border-y border-border-primary py-10 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-16 md:py-14">
      <section id="desktop" aria-labelledby="desktop-heading" class="min-w-0">
        <Monitor class="mb-5 h-8 w-8 text-accent" />
        <h2 id="desktop-heading" class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">Linux desktop</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 mb-6 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">For x86_64 Linux desktops with glibc. Browse local files without a server, or connect to a BoxBox server running the pairing API.</p>
        <DesktopDownload />
        <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted">Built on Ubuntu 24.04. Requires GTK 3, WebKitGTK 4.1 and Ayatana AppIndicator. See the guide for distro packages and optional preview helpers. Windows, macOS and ARM desktop packages are not available.</p>
      </section>
      <section aria-labelledby="server-heading" class="min-w-0 border-t border-border-primary pt-10 md:border-t-0 md:border-l md:pt-0 md:pl-12">
        <Server class="mb-5 h-8 w-8 text-accent" />
        <h2 id="server-heading" class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">Self-hosted server</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 mb-6 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">Deploy with Docker on Linux amd64 or arm64. Browse from any modern browser, create share links, and authorize desktop clients.</p>
        <a href="/docs/quickstart/" class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-accent px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-accent-hover">Deploy with Docker <ArrowUpRight class="h-5 w-5" /></a>
        <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-3 text-sm"><a href="https://github.com/jR4dh3y/BoxBox/releases" class="text-text-secondary hover:text-white hover:underline">Standalone server binaries</a><a href="/docs/release/" class="text-accent hover:underline">Release & upgrade notes</a></div>
        <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted">Server binaries do not include the desktop window or native file-manager integration. Configure credentials and mounted folders before starting.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">Already self-hosting? Update your server before pairing the desktop app. Generate a code in <strong class="text-text-primary">Settings → Account</strong>, then add the server under <strong class="text-text-primary">Settings → Connections</strong> on desktop.</p>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</Layout>
